OL,3,AHeartbroken bride visited Dad in
OL,4,Ahospital on wedding day
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bride who was "completely
OL,7,Fheartbroken" when her dad was admitted
OL,8,Fto hospital with heart problems just
OL,9,Ftwo days before her wedding decided to
OL,10,Fspend part of her big day on his ward.
OL,12,FSinead Jackson was set to marry her
OL,13,Fpartner of 19 years Stephen on 10
OL,14,FOctober at the Village Hotel in Hyde,
OL,15,FGreater Manchester when her dad, Leslie
OL,16,FHealy, was admitted to Tameside General
OL,17,FHospital.
OL,19,FThe 36-year-old, from Dukinfield, said
OL,20,Fshe had always dreamed of having her
OL,21,Ffather walking her down the aisle.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
